{{- define "custom.app" -}}
[parcelapp-mcp](https://github.com/obeone/parcelapp-mcp) is a [Model Context Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io)
server around the API of [Parcel](https://parcelapp.net), the iOS/macOS delivery-tracking
app. It lets an LLM client list your deliveries, register new tracking numbers and
look up carrier codes. This chart runs it with its streamable-http transport, so the
MCP endpoint is reachable over the cluster network instead of only over stdio.

The Parcel API is a premium feature of the app: you need an active subscription and
an API key before any of the tools return something useful.
{{- end -}}

